    "Getting started  >  Account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prvi koraki  >  Račun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to My Account > Delete account. Your personal data is removed; records of past purchases are kept anonymised, as required for accounting.\n\nValid tickets on a deleted account cannot be recovered, so use them or send them to a friend first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pojdi na Moj račun > Izbriši račun. Tvoji osebni podatki bodo izbrisani; zapisi preteklih nakupov ostanejo anonimizirani, kot to zahteva računovodstvo.\n\nVeljavnih vstopnic na izbrisanem računu ni mogoče obnoviti, zato jih najprej uporabi ali pošlji prijatelju."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to My Account > Request for creator and fill in the short form. We review requests by hand — you can follow the status on the same screen.\n\nOnce approved, your profile switches to the business view: Dashboard, Events, Scan tickets and Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pojdi na Moj račun > Prošnja za ustvarjalca in izpolni kratek obrazec. Prošnje pregledamo ročno — stanje lahko spremljaš na istem zaslonu.\n\nKo je odobrena, se tvoj profil preklopi na poslovni pogled: Pregled, Dogodki, Skeniraj vstopnice in Nastavitve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Going": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
