    "Join me on Outly — see where we're going out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pridruži se mi na Outlyju – vidiš, kam gremo ven."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join our platform and promote your club, bar, or event to thousands of tourists and locals. With a business account, you can publish events, sell tickets directly through the app, and connect with your audience in real time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pridruži se platformi in promoviraj svoj klub, bar ali dogodek tisočim turistom in domačinom. S poslovnim računom lahko objavljaš dogodke, prodajaš vstopnice neposredno prek aplikacije in se v realnem času povezuješ s svojim občinstvom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join them": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pridruži se"
          }
        }
