      }
    },
    "Offers from clubs": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ponudbe klubov"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the login screen tap Forgot password and enter your email. We send you a code; enter it together with a new password.\n\nIf you are logged in, go to My Account > Password and security to change your password. This logs you out on all other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zaslonu za prijavo tapni Forgot password (pozabljeno geslo) in vnesi e-pošto. Pošljemo ti kodo; vnesi jo skupaj z novim geslom.\n\nČe si prijavljen(a), pojdi na Moj račun > Geslo in varnost, da spremeniš geslo. To te odjavi na vseh drugih napravah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the map ✓": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zemljevidu ✓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the selected genres is not available. Reload and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eden od izbranih žanrov ni na voljo. Osveži in poskusi znova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the club owner can do that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To lahko naredi samo lastnik kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your three most popular past events can have a video. This keeps your club page fast to open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video lahko dobijo samo trije najbolj priljubljeni pretekli dogodki. Tako se stran tvojega kluba hitro odpre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open My friends to accept": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Moje prijatelje za sprejem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile > Tickets and tap the ticket. Show the QR code to the staff at the entrance — they scan it with Outly.\n\nA ticket can be scanned only once. Screenshots work, but keep your brightness up so the code is readable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Vstopnice in tapni vstopnico. Kodo QR pokaži osebju pri vhodu — skenirajo jo z Outlyjem.\n\nVstopnico je mogoče skenirati samo enkrat. Posnetek zaslona deluje, a naj bo osvetlitev dovolj visoka, da je koda berljiva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri nastavitve"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event and tap the price bar under the poster. Choose how many tickets you want and confirm.\n\nYour tickets appear under Profile > Tickets right away. Each ticket has its own QR code.\n\nEvents marked 18+ require a date of birth in your profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in tapni cenovno vrstico pod plakatom. Izberi, koliko vstopnic želiš, in potrdi.\n\nVstopnice se takoj prikažejo pod Profil > Vstopnice. Vsaka vstopnica ima svojo kodo QR.\n\nDogodki z oznako 18+ zahtevajo datum rojstva v tvojem profilu."
          }
