          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets are paid at checkout. Payments are processed by Stripe; Outly never sees or stores your card details, and the app does not hold a balance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice plačaš ob nakupu. Plačila obdeluje Stripe; Outly nikoli ne vidi ali shranjuje podatkov tvoje kartice, aplikacija pa ne vodi stanja denarnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets are sold by the club; Outly is the marketplace. Because a ticket is for a specific date, there is no 14-day right of withdrawal after purchase.\n\nIf the club cancels an event, you are entitled to a refund from the club, to your original payment method.\n\nFor anything else, contact the club or write to luka@outly.si with your ticket number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice prodaja klub; Outly je tržnica. Ker je vstopnica vezana na določen datum, po nakupu ni 14-dnevne pravice do odstopa.\n\nČe klub odpove dogodek, imaš pravico do vračila denarja s strani kluba na izvirni način plačila.\n\nZa vse ostalo se obrni na klub ali piši na luka@outly.si s številko svoje vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets for a dated event cannot be returned after purchase (ZVPot-1, 135/12). The seller is the club; Outly is the intermediary.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnic za dogodek z določenim datumom po nakupu ni mogoče vrniti (ZVPot-1, 135/12). Prodajalec je klub; Outly je posrednik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
