          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spustim gosta noter?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code could not be checked on the phone. The server checks it later; if it is not valid, it shows up under Conflicts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te kode telefon ni mogel preveriti. Strežnik jo preveri pozneje; če ni veljavna, se pokaže pod Konflikti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list could not be refreshed for a while. Tickets bought or refunded since then are not in it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seznama že nekaj časa ni bilo mogoče osvežiti. Vstopnice, kupljene ali vrnjene od takrat, niso v njem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are no longer on this club's team. The downloaded lists were removed from this phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
